---
description: >-
  Regression test for issue #5496 — uses a seconds-only "dateFormat ss"
  with "tickInterval 1second" for a short network-request timeline,
  verifying seconds-only date parsing/formatting.
---
gantt
  tickInterval 1second
  dateFormat ss
  axisFormat %s

  section Network Request
  RTT : rtt, 0, 20
